00:31:04.180 --> 00:31:05.680
for the topology
you want to set up,

00:31:05.680 --> 00:31:09.730
like the replicas and
the disk you want to use,

00:31:09.730 --> 00:31:10.990
things like those.

00:31:10.990 --> 00:31:14.530
So while we are here,
I wanted to show--

00:31:14.530 --> 00:31:18.450
we talked about how
controller-tools

00:31:18.450 --> 00:31:21.550
