00:33:31.030 --> 00:33:34.290
to do is being able to
watch, observe the resources.

00:33:34.290 --> 00:33:37.367
So you will see that this
requires just a simple--

00:33:37.367 --> 00:33:38.950
so we have these
high level APIs where

00:33:38.950 --> 00:33:44.100
you can say, I want to watch
