00:33:53.310 --> 00:33:54.870
for orchestrating the SqlDB.

00:33:54.870 --> 00:33:57.850
So we are watching those
resources, as well.

00:33:57.850 --> 00:33:59.640
And then some of
the things where

00:33:59.640 --> 00:34:04.410
you can set up the ownership
hierarchy, which is--

00:34:04.410 --> 00:34:06.720
with just a few lines
of code here, it

00:34:06.720 --> 00:34:08.440
will automatically set up--

00:34:08.440 --> 00:34:09.630
OK.

00:34:09.630 --> 00:34:12.750
It will trigger write
