00:44:22.820 --> 00:44:25.900
So now the third step,
which is we want to restore,

00:44:25.900 --> 00:44:29.330
which is another Day N operation
that we want to perform.

00:44:29.330 --> 00:44:31.690
So restoration workflows,
what you want to do

00:44:31.690 --> 00:44:33.970
is we'll be using db2 here.

00:44:33.970 --> 00:44:36.000
We want to bring
another instance.

00:44:36.000 --> 00:44:38.710
We want to restore from the
backup that we took earlier.

00:44:38.710 --> 00:44:42.240
And we'll just use the backup
name, db1-backup, here.

00:44:42.240 --> 00:44:49.150
So we just apply this.

00:44:49.150 --> 00:44:59.970
And yeah, so with that,
we see db2 is also ready.

